# Line endings are a property of this repository, not of whoever checked it out.
#
# Every tracked text file is stored LF in the index, and the harness parses many
# of them (plans, agent/skill frontmatter, learning frontmatter, hooks). Without
# this pin, Git for Windows applies its core.autocrlf=true default and hands
# those files back as CRLF, which silently changed parse results and token
# measurements — the root cause of six Windows-only test failures and of a real
# knowledge-store frontmatter data-loss bug.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binaries byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
